    <item>
      <title>Tạo project mới chỉ sử dụng file xib (Updated to Xcode 15)</title>
      <link>https://ducpa.id.vn/posts/project_with_xib_only/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 29 Apr 2024 15:17:30 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://ducpa.id.vn/posts/project_with_xib_only/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bước 1:&lt;/strong&gt; Xóa các config và file không cần thiết&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Xóa Main storyboard file base name và &lt;strong&gt;Window Application Session Role&lt;/strong&gt; trong &lt;code&gt;info.plist &amp;gt; Application Scence Manifest &amp;gt; Scene Configuration&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Xóa các config và file không cần thiết&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://ducpa.id.vn/posts/project_with_xib_only/images/config_xib_1.png#center&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Xóa bỏ các file không cần thiết&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Xóa các config và file không cần thiết&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://ducpa.id.vn/posts/project_with_xib_only/images/config_xib_2.png#center&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bước 2:&lt;/strong&gt; Tạo &lt;strong&gt;UIViewController&lt;/strong&gt; mới&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Tạo UIViewController mới&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://ducpa.id.vn/posts/project_with_xib_only/images/config_xib_3.png#center&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bước 3:&lt;/strong&gt; Chỉnh sửa file &lt;strong&gt;App Delegate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Khai báo biến &lt;code&gt;windows&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-Swift&#34; data-lang=&#34;Swift&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; window:UIWindow?
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thêm UIViewController mới vào &lt;code&gt;didFinishLaunchingWithOptions&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-Swift&#34; data-lang=&#34;Swift&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;window = UIWindow(frame: UIScreen.main.bounds)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;guard&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; window = window &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;	print(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Unexpected result when app&amp;#39;s main window is nill&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;	&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;window.rootViewController = HomeViewController() &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// Doi thanh viewcontroller cua ban&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;window.makeKeyAndVisible()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hoàn thiện&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Hoàn thiện&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://ducpa.id.vn/posts/project_with_xib_only/images/config_xib_4.png#center&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
